{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The spec and ADR define a receipt as proof of explicit closeout, and a recorded review must still be verified under `never`. I’m checking that receipt handling and the reached, attention, doctor, and federation readers enforce that distinction."}}
