{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_96","type":"agent_message","text":"The recovery path also treats a historical roadmap as an interrupted close and can backfill a receipt under today’s policy. Separately, receipts bind milestone exit gates but omit roadmap cut criteria, allowing a repeated close to skip a newly failing cut gate. I’ll report these separately from the fixes I verified in the prior findings."}}
